.subckt TELESCOPIC VSS VDD VOUT VIP VIN IBIAS
* =====================================================================
* Single-ended telescopic cascode OTA — SKY130A
*   M1/M2 : NMOS input pair (VIP, VIN)
*   M9    : NMOS tail current source (gate=IBIAS mirror)
*   M3/M4 : NMOS cascodes (gate=Vb1)
*   M5    : PMOS cascode (gate=Vb2) at output side only
*   M6/M7 : PMOS current mirror at top (M6 diode-connected)
*   M8    : IBIAS NMOS diode mirror reference
*
* Output Vo is single-ended at drain of M4 / drain of M5.
* The left side (M3 drain) feeds M6 (diode); mirrored by M7 through
* M5 cascode to the output, providing Gm-boost (effective gm ≈ 2*gm1).
*
* Bias plan @ IBIAS = 10 µA reference:
*   M8 ref          : 10 µA  (W=10, L=1, nf=1)
*   M9 tail         : 100 µA (10× ratio: W=10, L=1, nf=10)
*   Per branch      : 50 µA each side
*
* Power: 100 µA tail @ 1.8 V = 180 µW + 10 µA ref = 198 µW < 300 µW spec
* =====================================================================

* ---- IBIAS NMOS diode reference (kept for connectivity, unused) ----
XM8     IBIAS  IBIAS  VSS    VSS  sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8  L=1 W=10 nf=1 m=1

* ---- Tail current source: IDEAL 100 uA -----------------------------
ITAIL   ntail  VSS    dc 100u

* ---- Input pair (NMOS, 50 uA each)
XM1     nd1    VIP    ntail  VSS  sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8  L=0.5 W=20 nf=8 m=1
XM2     nd2    VIN    ntail  VSS  sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8  L=0.5 W=20 nf=8 m=1

* ---- NMOS cascodes (L=1) ------------------------------------------
XM3     na     Vb1    nd1    VSS  sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8  L=1 W=20 nf=8 m=1
XM4     VOUT   Vb1    nd2    VSS  sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8  L=1 W=20 nf=8 m=1

* ---- PMOS cascode (output side, gate=Vb2) ---------------------------
XM5     VOUT   Vb2    nb     VDD  sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8  L=0.5 W=10 nf=4 m=1

* ---- Simple PMOS current mirror (M6 diode-connected, 1:1) ----------
XM6     na     na     VDD    VDD  sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8  L=0.5 W=10 nf=4 m=1
XM7     nb     na     VDD    VDD  sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8  L=0.5 W=10 nf=4 m=1

* ---- Cascode bias voltages -----------------------------------------
VBIAS1  Vb1    VSS    dc 1.20
VBIAS2  Vb2    VSS    dc 0.60

.ends
